OL,3,GNEWSAVan driver dies after being hit by
OL,4,Acar on main road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA van driver died after being struck by
OL,7,Fa car on the A38 in Derbyshire, police
OL,8,Fhave said.
OL,10,FA Citroen Berlingo van was travelling
OL,11,Fon the northbound carriageway near
OL,12,FAlfreton just before 19:50 BST on
OL,13,FSunday when it was involved in a crash
OL,14,Fnear the junction with the B600.
OL,16,FThe driver of the van then got out of
OL,17,Fhis vehicle and was hit by a car, a
OL,18,FDerbyshire Police spokesperson said.
OL,20,FThe man suffered serious injuries and
OL,21,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene.
